sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as SSE client
    participant H as HTTP handler
    participant F as stream fanout hub
    participant R as Redis
    C->>H: GET offset and live=sse
    H->>R: Get metadata and incarnation
    H->>F: acquire stream hub
    F->>R: SUBSCRIBE and confirm
    F->>R: read durable suffix once
    F-->>H: hub ready
    H->>R: catch up from client offset
    H->>R: recheck metadata and incarnation
    H-->>C: data then control offset
    H->>F: attach watcher at sent offset
    Note over H,F: no gap between catch-up and live delivery
    R-->>F: append wake hint
    F->>R: read new durable suffix once
    F-->>H: shared immutable data event
    H-->>C: shared data then client control
